    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Touch one undead creature you control. On a failed Will save it is reduced to dust, and you regain hit points equal to the hit points it had remaining, up to your maximum. If its save succeeds, it survives and ceases to be under your control.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Verify control, roll the save, destroy or release the undead, and transfer its remaining hit-point value manually.</p>"
    },
